WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.968
Hi, Leo! Let's have a coffee?

2
00:00:03.418 --> 00:00:04.533
Great idea!

3
00:00:05.983 --> 00:00:08.305
So, what will you have?

4
00:00:08.755 --> 00:00:11.309
Hmm… I'll have a cappuccino, please.

5
00:00:13.559 --> 00:00:16.856
Oh, no! I left my wallet at home!

6
00:00:17.306 --> 00:00:19.118
Don't worry. I'll pay today.

7
00:00:19.568 --> 00:00:23.097
Thank you! I'll pay next time, I promise.

8
00:00:25.347 --> 00:00:29.248
Look, it's raining, and I don't have an umbrella!

9
00:00:29.698 --> 00:00:31.463
Shall I call a taxi for you?

10
00:00:33.713 --> 00:00:37.103
Sarah, you're my best friend. I'll always help you.

11
00:00:37.553 --> 00:00:40.757
Ha ha. And I'll always help you, too!

12
00:00:43.007 --> 00:00:45.794
And you? What will you have at a café?

